abstract: >-
  Material-agnostic data-integrity checks (A1--A5 leakage audits and three
  cheap pre-modeling screens) for small-sample materials-ML regression corpora,
  validated on three laser powder-bed fusion alloys (Ti-6Al-4V, 316L,
  Inconel 718).
